ffaires’ role is to represent the UK within an international organisation, engaging with every other country or organisation that belongs to or observes the body. The Ambassador is also responsible for the direction and work of the Mission. Ambassadors to multilateral missions are often referred to as ‘Permanent Representatives’.</p>\n","role_payment_type":null},"document_type":"ambassador_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-10-08T14:52:08Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Chargé d’Affaires, UK Mission to the UN, New York","withdrawn":false}],"speaker":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/people/kate-foster","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/people/kate-foster","base_path":"/government/people/kate-foster","content_id":"a39a20f9-f8ee-4662-84b9-39cd76aaed63","document_type":"person","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-01T14:35:38Z","schema_name":"person","title":"Kate Foster OBE","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/people/kate-foster","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international/foreign-affairs","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international/foreign-affairs","base_path":"/international/foreign-affairs","content_id":"d6dba75a-42bd-4e1e-984c-2bddb6b41951","details":{"internal_name":"Foreign affairs [P]","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/international","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/international","base_path":"/international","content_id":"37d0fa26-abed-4c74-8835-b3b51ae1c8b2","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"International","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document_type":"homepage","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-02-1